WEBVTT

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:19.200
<i>C'mon, morning's here--time to be on our way</i>

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:24.700
<i>Smiling faces, courage,</i>
<i>we're bustin' out: glory days!</i>

00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:29.830
<i>You ready or not? Ready or not, go!</i>
<i>No turning back: this trip is nonfiction</i>

00:00:29.830 --> 00:00:35.080
<i>You ready or not? Ready or not, go!</i>
<i>It's now or never, the real deal: Ready, and... action!</i>

00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:40.540
<i>Harsh winds that make us hesitate,</i>
<i>nights spent crying our eyes out</i>

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:45.790
<i>They're not necessarily bad things (not bad)</i>

00:00:45.790 --> 00:00:51.500
<i>Just like the power in a spring:</i>
<i>the harder we're pushed</i>

00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:55.040
<i>The higher we can fly</i>

00:00:55.040 --> 00:01:05.580
<i>Face the far-off distance</i>
<i>and aim for the horizon: rising sun</i>

00:01:05.580 --> 00:01:10.870
<i>Holding our hands up to that morning sun</i>

00:01:10.870 --> 00:01:21.250
<i>Our shared feelings brought us together--</i>
<i>we're not alone anymore</i>

00:01:21.250 --> 00:01:27.450
<i>And so we're on this brilliant voyage</i>

00:01:27.450 --> 00:01:34.250
<i>Smiling faces, courage,</i>
<i>we're bustin' out: glory days!</i>

00:01:53.580 --> 00:01:54.870
So warm...

00:01:56.120 --> 00:02:00.500
That's right--this is new, this warmth.

00:02:01.750 --> 00:02:04.370
It's the first time I've ever had anyone...

00:02:06.540 --> 00:02:07.700
...hold me like this...

00:02:13.200 --> 00:02:17.330
I won't let them kill him.
I'll protect this child.

00:02:22.660 --> 00:02:26.000
What's takin' 'em? What's Shi Ka doin'?

00:02:28.450 --> 00:02:29.540
Sorry about that.

00:02:29.540 --> 00:02:31.370
Shi Ka! Where ya been?

00:02:31.370 --> 00:02:34.500
Hey, is the kid all right?

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:37.700
He's fine.

00:02:37.700 --> 00:02:39.950
Just fine.

00:02:40.370 --> 00:02:45.390
"Connecting Wishes"

00:03:00.580 --> 00:03:03.620
On their way to taking Sei,
the young boy destined to be King,

00:03:03.620 --> 00:03:06.160
back to the Kingdom of Chin,

00:03:06.160 --> 00:03:09.830
Shi Ka and her companions
passed through the final gate in Sho

00:03:09.830 --> 00:03:13.330
and drove their horses
along the road to the border.

00:03:13.330 --> 00:03:16.910
Yes! Yesss! We can do it!
We can go back to Chin!

00:03:18.160 --> 00:03:22.250
The horses are pretty tuckered out
from running so many days in a row.

00:03:22.250 --> 00:03:25.950
Maybe we wasted too much
time back there after all.

00:03:25.950 --> 00:03:28.700
Sho's trackers are the best
in the Middle Kingdom.

00:03:28.700 --> 00:03:31.790
If they find out about us,
it won't be long before--

00:03:37.080 --> 00:03:40.620
A dust cloud! There's a dust cloud behind us!

00:03:40.620 --> 00:03:42.450
The cavalry's on our tail!

00:03:42.450 --> 00:03:43.450
What?!

00:03:44.450 --> 00:03:46.200
And after we made it this far!

00:03:46.200 --> 00:03:49.160
Don't panic--they're still well behind us.

00:03:49.160 --> 00:03:53.290
Ready your weapons!
We'll make a fighting escape!

00:03:56.700 --> 00:03:59.200
Dou Ken! Where do we rendezvous?

00:03:59.200 --> 00:04:01.910
At a pond surrounded by pines!

00:04:02.870 --> 00:04:04.410
Aka Matsu Pond?

00:04:04.410 --> 00:04:09.040
It's too far!
Hell, Aka Matsu is across the border!

00:04:09.040 --> 00:04:12.410
No way... we can't stay ahead
of the cavalry for that long!

00:04:15.870 --> 00:04:16.660
A Mon!

00:04:16.660 --> 00:04:17.950
Yeah?

00:04:17.950 --> 00:04:22.410
You haven't forgotten that
promise we made as kids, right?

00:04:24.540 --> 00:04:26.160
As if I could...

00:04:32.870 --> 00:04:38.290
The last one of us three to die will be Shi Ka!

00:04:38.290 --> 00:04:40.620
We're livin' on borrowed time as it is!

00:04:40.620 --> 00:04:43.370
I've been prepared for this
ever since we started

00:04:43.370 --> 00:04:45.580
workin' on the black market!

00:04:45.580 --> 00:04:49.160
The only thing I regret is not makin' her mine!

00:04:49.160 --> 00:04:51.410
Shoulda told her how I felt, eh?

00:04:53.790 --> 00:04:55.330
I <i>did</i> .

00:04:55.950 --> 00:04:56.700
Huh?

00:04:56.700 --> 00:04:59.790
Asked her to marry me back when we were sixteen.

00:04:59.790 --> 00:05:02.870
What?! Wh-What happened?

00:05:02.870 --> 00:05:06.660
She turned me down and followed
in the old man's footsteps.

00:05:09.290 --> 00:05:10.410
So you were <i>dumped</i> !

00:05:10.410 --> 00:05:11.620
Aw, shut up!

00:05:11.620 --> 00:05:15.120
Still--you jerk! Keepin' such
big news from me all this time?

00:05:15.120 --> 00:05:16.160
Cut it out!

00:05:16.160 --> 00:05:17.950
Like I'd tell <i>you</i> !

00:05:43.790 --> 00:05:44.790
It can't be--

00:05:47.120 --> 00:05:49.830
The cavalry! The cavalry's here!

00:05:54.200 --> 00:05:56.290
Shi Ka, <i>run</i> !

00:05:59.540 --> 00:06:02.120
You traitors!

00:06:04.290 --> 00:06:06.160
Shi Kaaa!!

00:06:06.500 --> 00:06:09.700
Stay away from our commander, you bastard!

00:06:09.700 --> 00:06:10.700
A Mon!

00:06:16.000 --> 00:06:17.000
Tan Gen!

00:06:19.580 --> 00:06:23.000
Heh heh... Guess I shoulda told ya after all...

00:06:25.000 --> 00:06:26.000
Shi Ka...

00:06:29.500 --> 00:06:30.830
So long!

00:06:32.500 --> 00:06:33.500
A Mon!!

00:06:39.000 --> 00:06:40.660
<i>A Mon!</i>

00:06:41.910 --> 00:06:44.330
Damn it to hell!

00:06:48.750 --> 00:06:51.040
No sign of anything like that?

00:06:51.040 --> 00:06:54.200
Nothing at all!
Not a single dust cloud in sight!

00:06:54.200 --> 00:06:56.540
Maintain your observation!

00:06:56.540 --> 00:06:59.580
Be prepared for the cavalry
to appear at any moment!

00:06:59.580 --> 00:07:00.580
Sir!

00:07:17.620 --> 00:07:19.000
So this is it...

00:07:51.080 --> 00:07:53.250
Where are you going...?

00:07:53.250 --> 00:07:57.540
There's no place for you, here or anywhere...

00:07:57.540 --> 00:08:02.330
Just sleep... it's better that way...

00:08:19.160 --> 00:08:21.160
W-Wait...

00:08:24.120 --> 00:08:26.410
I <i>know</i> , Sei...

00:08:27.540 --> 00:08:30.660
A boy born of royal blood in an enemy land,

00:08:30.660 --> 00:08:32.830
made to bear the brunt of wartime grudges.

00:08:32.830 --> 00:08:38.040
You withdrew so completely
that you lost all sense of pain.

00:08:38.040 --> 00:08:44.040
But that doesn't mean
you're just some soulless doll.

00:08:44.040 --> 00:08:47.950
You've just kept on wondering,
asking yourself...

00:08:47.950 --> 00:08:50.500
About war, and people...

00:08:50.500 --> 00:08:51.830
and kingdoms...

00:08:51.830 --> 00:08:53.330
and kings.

00:08:55.790 --> 00:08:57.540
That's right.

00:08:57.540 --> 00:09:03.450
And now you're imagining a fearsome royal path.

00:09:05.200 --> 00:09:10.000
A terrible path that none have trod until now...

00:09:12.200 --> 00:09:14.000
Give it up.

00:09:14.000 --> 00:09:17.250
Going to sleep with us here

00:09:17.250 --> 00:09:18.870
will be far easier...

00:09:20.660 --> 00:09:23.250
Enough with your futile arguments.

00:09:23.250 --> 00:09:27.200
This woman held a hand out to me,
sunk deep into the darkness.

00:09:28.620 --> 00:09:30.660
A strong hand.

00:09:30.660 --> 00:09:33.040
Now there's nothing for me
to question, nothing to fear.

00:09:35.370 --> 00:09:38.700
I will return to Chin and be King!

00:09:46.080 --> 00:09:50.120
You are surrounded by a cruel path of death...

00:09:50.120 --> 00:09:52.120
You <i>will</i> suffer...

00:09:54.580 --> 00:09:56.790
I am prepared.

00:09:56.790 --> 00:09:58.500
I know I will--

00:10:09.290 --> 00:10:11.870
You're awake, my lord!

00:10:11.870 --> 00:10:12.870
Yes...

00:10:15.750 --> 00:10:18.120
Shi Ka! Your arm!

00:10:18.120 --> 00:10:21.620
Watch for stray arrows--
and please, keep your head down.

00:10:27.620 --> 00:10:30.040
You couldn't have woken up at a worse time!

00:10:31.620 --> 00:10:33.790
Dou Ken, how far to the rendezvous point?

00:10:33.790 --> 00:10:36.160
Another two hours or so...

00:10:36.160 --> 00:10:41.330
But I'm afraid we can't hold out
for more than thirty minutes!

00:10:41.330 --> 00:10:44.540
If the cavalry catches us, we'll be done for...

00:10:44.540 --> 00:10:47.160
I hate to say it, but... it ends here.

00:10:50.250 --> 00:10:51.500
Don't give up!

00:10:54.750 --> 00:10:58.200
You still have arrows!
The horses are still running!

00:10:58.200 --> 00:11:00.580
It's too early to be hanging your head!

00:11:00.580 --> 00:11:05.290
Think only of how to get one step closer to Chin!

00:11:05.290 --> 00:11:07.410
What's with him all of a sudden?

00:11:11.620 --> 00:11:13.080
Shi Ka,

00:11:13.080 --> 00:11:16.500
the soldiers at the rendezvous point
can come to us.

00:11:16.500 --> 00:11:19.290
It's not like you to give up so quickly!

00:11:20.620 --> 00:11:23.160
Besides, you said you'd take me to Chin!

00:11:24.370 --> 00:11:27.790
You really <i>have</i> awoken, haven't you.

00:11:27.790 --> 00:11:30.160
All because you held out your hand to me.

00:11:37.290 --> 00:11:40.660
<i>Now</i> he's found that determination of his!

00:11:41.750 --> 00:11:44.080
Those Chin mountain monkeys...

00:11:44.080 --> 00:11:46.830
Let's show them what we're made of!

00:11:46.830 --> 00:11:48.750
You have your target--fire!

00:11:53.830 --> 00:11:54.830
Dou Ken!

00:11:59.580 --> 00:12:02.330
A-Alas...

00:12:02.330 --> 00:12:06.040
L-Lord Sei... your pardon...

00:12:06.040 --> 00:12:07.040
Dou Ken!!

00:12:13.580 --> 00:12:15.040
Dammit...

00:12:15.040 --> 00:12:18.250
You are surrounded by a cruel path of death...

00:12:20.700 --> 00:12:22.450
Damn it all!

00:12:24.620 --> 00:12:27.970
"Shi Ka"

00:12:35.540 --> 00:12:37.040
Is that...

00:12:37.040 --> 00:12:38.410
Repooort!

00:12:51.450 --> 00:12:54.330
The Chin bastards have been eliminated.

00:12:54.330 --> 00:12:57.330
Now for the two merchants and Sei!

00:12:57.330 --> 00:13:00.950
Tear the two traitors to pieces
and let them rot in the fields!

00:13:00.950 --> 00:13:04.950
We'll return with Sei's head.
Leave his face untouched!

00:13:04.950 --> 00:13:07.910
But from the neck down,
he gets the same treatment as the others!

00:13:19.750 --> 00:13:27.950
Father... just as you saved us,
I tried to save this child,

00:13:28.790 --> 00:13:30.160
but it's hard going.

00:13:31.910 --> 00:13:35.200
I overestimated my own strength.

00:13:35.200 --> 00:13:38.540
I dragged A Mon and Kou Shou into it.

00:13:38.540 --> 00:13:42.950
I guess it's not so easy
to save someone's life after all.

00:13:44.620 --> 00:13:50.410
And with A Mon's sacrifice,
I harbor no illusions about my own rescue.

00:13:50.410 --> 00:13:54.620
But if I can't at least
pass it on to this child,

00:13:54.620 --> 00:13:57.660
hand down to him the life I've been given...

00:14:03.910 --> 00:14:05.080
A dust cloud!

00:14:10.790 --> 00:14:15.620
Hurry! You must bring Lord Sei
to Kanyou at any cost!

00:14:15.620 --> 00:14:16.620
Sir!

00:14:17.910 --> 00:14:19.080
Lord Sei...

00:14:19.080 --> 00:14:22.500
You take the reins. Hold them tightly.

00:14:23.910 --> 00:14:27.620
Now, driving the horses takes concentration.

00:14:27.620 --> 00:14:30.450
Whatever you do, don't look back.

00:14:31.500 --> 00:14:34.620
Shi Ka--what are you trying to do?

00:14:34.620 --> 00:14:36.580
My very best, until the very end.

00:14:38.700 --> 00:14:40.120
And no giving up!

00:14:43.290 --> 00:14:44.290
Shi Ka!

00:14:46.250 --> 00:14:47.250
Is that...

00:14:48.910 --> 00:14:51.080
The soldiers from our rendezvous!
They're coming this way!

00:14:52.200 --> 00:14:53.330
Will we make it?

00:14:57.370 --> 00:14:58.370
Kou Shou!

00:15:00.950 --> 00:15:05.290
Looks like my death won't be
nearly as cool as A Mon's...

00:15:06.500 --> 00:15:07.500
Still...

00:15:10.540 --> 00:15:14.620
For a life on borrowed time,
it was pretty damn good.

00:15:14.620 --> 00:15:19.410
'Cause I could live all of it
next to the woman I love...

00:15:19.410 --> 00:15:23.790
Shi Ka! Live every last second you can!

00:15:23.790 --> 00:15:24.790
Kou Shou!

00:15:29.450 --> 00:15:31.910
<i>Kou Shou!</i>

00:15:54.410 --> 00:15:55.410
Dammit!

00:15:56.870 --> 00:16:01.790
I'm sorry, Kou Shou... A Mon...

00:16:01.790 --> 00:16:04.410
I got you into this mess...

00:16:08.790 --> 00:16:12.620
All right! Now for Sei and the woman!

00:16:15.160 --> 00:16:16.700
Wait for me!

00:16:21.080 --> 00:16:24.080
She thinks she can draw a bow
with <i>those</i> scrawny arms?

00:16:26.000 --> 00:16:28.870
The woman's an archer! Stay sharp!

00:16:30.040 --> 00:16:32.250
That plank's in the way!
Circle around and flank her!

00:16:32.250 --> 00:16:33.250
Sir!

00:16:34.410 --> 00:16:36.250
Gotcha!

00:16:38.580 --> 00:16:39.660
Ten Bu!

00:16:39.660 --> 00:16:40.660
On it!

00:16:43.790 --> 00:16:45.120
Shi Ka!

00:16:45.120 --> 00:16:46.120
Don't look!

00:16:53.870 --> 00:16:54.870
Sh--

00:16:59.830 --> 00:17:01.000
It's not over yet!

00:17:03.000 --> 00:17:05.160
Enough! Keep still!

00:17:06.410 --> 00:17:09.750
Please, just be still!

00:17:09.750 --> 00:17:14.370
T-Tou Gan, sir! Dust cloud up ahead!

00:17:14.370 --> 00:17:16.500
The Chin cavalry, eh?

00:17:16.500 --> 00:17:20.330
So they've crossed the
border to come meet Sei!

00:17:20.330 --> 00:17:23.620
But they're still far off! Playtime is over!

00:17:23.620 --> 00:17:27.040
Get on that horsecart and bring me Sei's head!

00:17:34.580 --> 00:17:38.120
Why? Why go to such lengths?

00:17:39.540 --> 00:17:44.200
When I was young, I too was
saved by a complete stranger.

00:17:48.540 --> 00:17:54.870
When I was ten, he lost his life
trying to save someone else.

00:17:59.250 --> 00:18:05.160
I wailed as he lay dying, begging him not to go.

00:18:05.160 --> 00:18:09.450
That I hadn't yet repaid
a single one of his kindnesses...

00:18:14.370 --> 00:18:15.950
But he said...

00:18:20.790 --> 00:18:24.330
Pay all those favors forward.

00:18:25.370 --> 00:18:30.790
My life was saved by the
lives of countless others.

00:18:31.790 --> 00:18:36.410
In turn, I have bestowed
those favors upon you three.

00:18:37.750 --> 00:18:43.830
Shi Ka, if you can do something
for someone down the road,

00:18:43.830 --> 00:18:48.870
it will mean so very much to me.

00:18:48.870 --> 00:18:53.700
No matter how small,
you must take the favors you receive

00:18:53.700 --> 00:18:55.200
and pay them forward.

00:18:57.250 --> 00:19:02.120
That's the way you do it, Shi Ka.
That's how...

00:19:03.830 --> 00:19:05.250
Move!

00:19:08.700 --> 00:19:09.580
Shi Ka!

00:19:09.580 --> 00:19:10.620
Don't look!

00:19:19.450 --> 00:19:21.540
That's how...

00:19:21.540 --> 00:19:24.750
That's how people are connected...

00:19:26.750 --> 00:19:29.540
And that's how I was taught...

00:19:30.910 --> 00:19:34.080
So that's why... why you...

00:19:34.080 --> 00:19:37.370
There is that, yes. But that's not all.

00:19:44.040 --> 00:19:48.450
To see the moon we saw that night...
one more time, with you...

00:19:54.290 --> 00:19:56.620
I won't let you...

00:19:56.620 --> 00:19:58.000
kill this child!

00:19:59.370 --> 00:20:01.830
What are you doing?! Kill her!

00:20:01.830 --> 00:20:03.370
I won't <i>let</i> you!

00:20:06.950 --> 00:20:09.870
There he is! Lord Sei!

00:20:09.870 --> 00:20:13.540
Shi Ka! The Chin soldiers--help has arrived!

00:20:14.660 --> 00:20:16.950
Forget the woman! Go for Sei!

00:20:20.250 --> 00:20:22.910
Stay strong, Shi Ka! We're so close!

00:20:22.910 --> 00:20:25.000
Fire!!

00:20:28.160 --> 00:20:29.500
Shi Ka!

00:20:29.910 --> 00:20:31.700
What's <i>with</i> her?!

00:20:32.910 --> 00:20:34.790
Kill her!!

00:20:39.620 --> 00:20:41.950
Lord Sei!!

00:20:43.410 --> 00:20:44.410
Sh...

00:20:51.200 --> 00:20:57.160
Sh... <i>Shi Kaaa</i> !

00:21:10.080 --> 00:21:12.790
Lord... Sei...

00:21:13.910 --> 00:21:15.950
What is it?

00:21:15.950 --> 00:21:19.000
Are you... hurt?

00:21:22.540 --> 00:21:28.830
I'm fine. I'm headed back to Chin, thanks to you.

00:21:28.830 --> 00:21:31.620
Thanks to you, I shall be King.

00:21:34.750 --> 00:21:40.370
Don't... forget about...
poor Dou Ken... and the rest...

00:21:40.370 --> 00:21:42.450
You're right.

00:21:42.440 --> 00:21:47.540
Dou Ken, Tan Gen, Ten Ji,
A Mon, Kou Shou...

00:21:47.540 --> 00:21:49.040
All of them.

00:21:51.330 --> 00:21:52.750
Lord Sei...

00:21:54.120 --> 00:21:58.580
The misfortune of your birth
made you tread a path

00:21:58.580 --> 00:22:00.950
royalty rarely walks.

00:22:02.330 --> 00:22:11.540
But no one else will become King
having experienced such hardship...

00:22:12.660 --> 00:22:15.580
And so... I am certain...

00:22:17.540 --> 00:22:23.120
...you will be a greater King than anyone else...

00:22:28.290 --> 00:22:29.200
Shi Ka!

00:22:29.200 --> 00:22:32.620
Dammit... dammit!

00:22:34.370 --> 00:22:39.000
Lord Sei... your face...

00:22:41.080 --> 00:22:43.830
Your eyes...

00:22:48.660 --> 00:22:52.160
Your demons have left you!

00:22:52.160 --> 00:22:55.410
Your eyes--they're so...

00:22:55.410 --> 00:22:57.910
...beautiful...

00:23:14.000 --> 00:23:18.120
<i>Shi Kaaa</i> !

00:23:48.830 --> 00:23:51.750
<i>What do you think?</i>

00:23:51.750 --> 00:23:54.830
<i>Why would the voice that melted into the sky</i>

00:23:54.830 --> 00:23:59.450
<i>Peel away and disappear?</i>

00:24:00.790 --> 00:24:03.790
<i>Just a single word</i>

00:24:03.790 --> 00:24:06.830
<i>If that's all you'd say</i>

00:24:06.830 --> 00:24:11.700
<i>What kind of word would you choose?</i>

00:24:12.540 --> 00:24:15.910
<i>Holding my breath and making sure</i>

00:24:15.910 --> 00:24:18.870
<i>The heartbeat can't wait</i>

00:24:18.870 --> 00:24:24.830
<i>If I let go of your hand, I'll want even more</i>

00:24:24.830 --> 00:24:28.450
<i>And so I keep on doing this</i>

00:24:28.450 --> 00:24:30.910
<i>Not allowing myself to stop</i>

00:24:30.910 --> 00:24:35.700
<i>Because I'm still searching for answers</i>

00:24:35.700 --> 00:24:39.370
<i>I want you to tell me</i>

00:24:41.700 --> 00:24:46.200
<i>Before you melt away into the sky</i>

00:24:52.000 --> 00:24:58.010
